# ⚖️ The Verdict Engine

An AI-powered Decision Intelligence platform that researches, compares, scores, and ranks options using transparent, evidence-based analysis.

---

# 📌 Overview

The Verdict Engine helps users make confident decisions by combining AI-assisted research with verifiable data sources.

Users can compare products, services, career options, universities, technologies, investment opportunities, or any other alternatives using customizable evaluation criteria and weighted scoring.

Instead of relying on opinions, the platform presents research-backed comparisons with transparent citations.

